# FOH work log

When you finish meaningful work in a Front of House project, append one work-log line.

```bash
~/.redmax/chambers/bin/worklog "what you did"
```

Example: `~/.redmax/chambers/bin/worklog "fixed the gateway port mismatch"`

If the helper is missing, append one line under today's heading in `WORKLOG.md`:

```
## YYYY-MM-DD
- HH:MM | cursor | note | what you did
```

One short sentence. Intent and outcome. Append only. Do not rewrite history.
This applies to Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, and local agents.
